Z||000000||grinthock||05-15-2001||01:47 PM||||Ok here goes a very frugal attempt to get everyone togeather.<P>I will be at Hutches (Hamilton Bay Area) Thursday Night, anyone interested in hanging out and chatting fiero's come on by, I am looking to make this a bi-weekly event... Thursdays are NOT carved in stone, so anyone who likes a better day let me know....<P>Directions?  Tkae the QEW Past burlington, over the skyway and exit at WOODWARD, go right, then take your next Right onto beach road and Hutches is on your left, every night is "car show" night, ricers, burnout and the like.....  It's almost ALWAYS a great spot (sundays' WERE the best but now the fuzz are staking the place out Sundays!)||||reg||4
Z||000001||Wannabe||05-15-2001||05:47 PM||||Hutches! That's practically in my back yard! Here's to the local Fiero community! Unfortunately, I may not be able to attend this Thursday as I will be working on the car to prepare it for lapping at Mosport on Friday. Hopefully it will be together early enough that I can make it out!||||reg||1
