Z||000010||Jay||05-20-2001||05:04 PM||||I guess that means you wont be doing the newsletter for the GTA club anymore!  Good luck on starting a club!  One thing I don't understand is complaining about the drive to WESTON (not Markham or North York).  Summer is the best time to drive to the club meetings, last week we had over 20 show up.  Driving to the meeting is half the fun!  It takes me sometimes 45 min to get to the meetings from Scarborough.  After all it is the Greater Toronto Area Club and that includes surrounding areas.  We would love to have you all stay in the club but if you must start your own club, keep us up to speed so that we can plan events together (like going to Michigan) and our own show in September.  Once again Good Luck! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
